attribution: Words and music by Tell Taylor (died 1937); first published in 1910 (Star Music, Chicago, then M. Witmark & Sons). Earl K. Smith (died 1954), who later claimed a share of the music, also died before 1972. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
