melody:
# Chorus (valse lento; the pickup "Down by the" is held with fermatas in the sheet)
Down by the old mill stream, where I first met you,
D4 G4 B4 D5(3) C#5(3) C5(3) ~C5 D#4 E4 B4(3) A4(3) G4(3) ~G4
With your eyes of blue, dressed in ging-ham too.
B3 D4 G4(3) F#4(3) E4(3) ~E4 D#4 E4 F#4(3) E4(3) D4(3) ~D4
It was there I knew that you loved me true.
G4 B4 D5(3) C#5(3) C5(3) ~C5 D#4 E4 B4(3) A4(3) G4(3) ~G4.
You were six-teen, my vil-lage queen, by the old mill stream.
G4/ F#4/ G4/ Bb4(3) ~Bb4. G4/ F#4/ G4/ B4(3) ~B4 C5 B4 E4(3) B4(3) G4(2) r

